From 81b1c8f52510ff07b4171020a5892f0a1e5bcead Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mesh-LLM CI <ci@mesh-llm.local>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 18:49:55 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(skippy): restore quantized CacheGen pages on device

Assisted-by: scama
---
